'''Leafia''' is a Trekker in [[Stella Sora]]. She is a member of the [[Trekker Association]], specifically the Emor Branch. She is a mapping enthusiast.

== Profile ==
''"Mapping data into lines and recording every detail on paper—that's Leafia's calling as a surveyor."''

