{{TrekkerSkill
| name = Crystal Vein Survey
| brief = Unleashes Stratum Echo to deal DMG and generate {{word|Resource Markers|}}. Can consume {{word|Resource Markers|}} to generate Observation Points.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Forest Elf Essence}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill}} {{Item|Shooter Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Barrage Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Demon Bee Game Cartridge}}
| cooldown = 18.0
| desc_1 = Unleashes Stratum Echo, dealing {{color|#fb8037|65%}} of ATK as AoE Terra Skill DMG and generating 5 {{word|Resource Markers|}}. When there are more than 10 {{word|Resource Markers|}}, consumes 10 to generate 1 Observation Point for 10s (max 1 active). The Observation Point fires bullets at the Main Trekker's target every 3s, dealing {{color|#fb8037|19.4%}} of ATK as Terra Auto Attack DMG. All these attacks can trigger {{word|Terra Mark|earth}}, dealing {{SkillLevelHint|breakthrough|18%/23.4%/28.8%/34.1%/39.5%/44.9%/50.3%/55.7%/61%}} of ATK as AoE Terra Mark DMG.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Shooter Game Cartridge|quantity=6}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill|quantity=2}} {{Item|Dorra|quantity=13300}}
| desc_2 = Unleashes Stratum Echo, dealing {{color|#fb8037|74%}} of ATK as AoE Terra Skill DMG and generating 5 {{word|Resource Markers|}}. When there are more than 10 {{word|Resource Markers|}}, consumes 10 to generate 1 Observation Point for 10s (max 1 active). The Observation Point fires bullets at the Main Trekker's target every 3s, dealing {{color|#fb8037|22.3%}} of ATK as Terra Auto Attack DMG. All these attacks can trigger {{word|Terra Mark|earth}}, dealing {{SkillLevelHint|breakthrough|18%/23.4%/28.8%/34.1%/39.5%/44.9%/50.3%/55.7%/61%}} of ATK as AoE Terra Mark DMG.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Shooter Game Cartridge|quantity=12}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill|quantity=6}} {{Item|Dorra|quantity=17600}}
| desc_3 = Unleashes Stratum Echo, dealing {{color|#fb8037|84%}} of ATK as AoE Terra Skill DMG and generating 5 {{word|Resource Markers|}}. When there are more than 10 {{word|Resource Markers|}}, consumes 10 to generate 1 Observation Point for 10s (max 1 active). The Observation Point fires bullets at the Main Trekker's target every 3s, dealing {{color|#fb8037|25.2%}} of ATK as Terra Auto Attack DMG. All these attacks can trigger {{word|Terra Mark|earth}}, dealing {{SkillLevelHint|breakthrough|18%/23.4%/28.8%/34.1%/39.5%/44.9%/50.3%/55.7%/61%}} of ATK as AoE Terra Mark DMG.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Shooter Game Cartridge|quantity=24}} {{Item|Barrage Game Cartridge|quantity=3}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill|quantity=10}} {{Item|Dorra|quantity=49800}}
